mercs2_formats includes code and test data derived from the following third-party works.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
gfxforge-web — https://github.com/loganw234/mercs2-tools-gfxforge-web (commit 9c5c12e)
gfxforge     — https://github.com/loganw234/mercs2-tools-gfxforge     (commit 42cca07)

Used by: the `gfx` module's Scaleform GFx authoring layers (SWF tag writers, the AVM1 assembler,
the AS2 compiler, the movie builder, the verifier, the AVM1 interpreter) and the frozen test
fixtures under tests/fixtures/gfxforge/. Where the upstream behaviour disagrees with the retail
Mercenaries 2 movies, the retail bytes are followed and the difference is recorded in
docs/data/gfxforge_port_ledger.json of the notes repository.

